      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>\n<p>What was written for him, and my letters which were supposed to reach Kohen al-Raml\u012b</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>In the \u1e0dub\u0101ra binding, reached Maim\u016bn, which I had pierced with a hole</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>And I have sent them towards Kohen with the messenger carrying this letter</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Give him one silver for all of it. </p>\n</li>\n</ol>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
