          "value": "xywh=pixel:2438.9453125,776.5455322265625,2016.10009765625,1356.9278564453125",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso (Address)",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>\n<p>For my beloved son, Ab\u016b Sur\u016br Fara\u1e25 b. Isma\u02bf\u012bl b. Fara\u1e25&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>May God prolong his life and perpetuate his help, safety, and glory</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Let it arrive/be delivered to my Master Ab\u012b Ya\u1e25y\u0101 Nahray b. Niss\u012bm</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;from Isma\u02bf\u012bl b. Fara\u1e25</p>\n</li>\n</ol>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 2
    },
    {
